  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>k</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Real part of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mfenced><mi>u</mi></mfenced><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">+</mo><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8722;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn></msup><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8722;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Imaginary part of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>Im</mi><mfenced><mi>u</mi></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Re</mi><mfenced><mi>u</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>Im</mi><mfenced><mi>u</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-axis put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>Q</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>"
